        "toolDescription": "CRITICAL: Publishing to this topic triggers the actual Franka arm in the Isaac Sim simulation. The script subscribes to franka/control and only activates the Franka pick-and-place when it receives a message here. You MUST publish to this topic to start the pick-and-place operation.",
